HST Office: the Home tab's Tools button drops its caption before Paragraph collapses.

Tools shows as its captioned button ("Công cụ ▾") as soon as the groups at full size do not fit beside it.
A later rung now drops the caption for a bare arrow (the caption stays its tooltip and accessible name),
only when those 60-odd pixels alone keep the merged box from collapsing the group its tab names in
vcl/inc/HstRibbonBlocks.hxx (Paragraph in Writer and Slides, hst-ribbon-tools-bare-ladders.patch).

- PriorityMergedHBox: keeps the ladder's last input and plans another width without changing anything
  (HstBlockShouldBeBare); the un-collapse pass is shared by both.
- DropdownBox: measures its button with the caption and bare once, and switches between them.
- PriorityHBox: asks the merged box after the block's own collapse.

